      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Martinsdale%2C_Montana",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Poet Grace Stone Coates, author of Black Cherries and other works, called Martinsdale home during her creative years.",
